hats-specific file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]walker that yields YYYYMM shards, legacy top-level files, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]imported `v2-*` shard directories, then route the existing chat [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]storage/catalog/resume helpers through it so imported remote transcripts[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stop being invisible.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Register the Chats sub-tab across TUI plumbing[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scaffold[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 2 — Sub-tab scaffold\" section: register `chats` in the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Artifacts sub-tab constants, compose an empty `ArtifactsChatsPane`, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire bindings, keymaps, default config, command palette metadata, action[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gating, help modal, onboarding, and quickstart copy for the new pane.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Headless chat catalog with sync provenance[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after discovery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 3 — Headless provenance catalog\" section: build a TUI-independent[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chat catalog that resolves each transcript's owning agent, classifies it[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as local / shared / remote / unknown against the agents sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checkout, and caches the expensive scans keyed by mtime and sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]HEAD.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase chat list exposes provenance[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 4 — CLI surface\" section: add a provenance column and machine [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]column to the `sase chat list` table, add `-P/--provenance` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`-m/--machine` filters, and extend the stable JSON schema with the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance fields.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Chats pane list, provenance badges, and loading[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after scaffold, catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 5 — Pane list and provenance rendering\" section: load the catalog[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]off-thread with a bounded first page, render date-grouped rows carrying [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a three-channel provenance badge and gutter stripe, and implement [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]navigation, refresh, and the shared Artifacts entry-navigator contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Chats detail panel, summary chips, and filter bar[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detail[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 6 — Detail panel and filters\" section: build the right-hand [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail panel with an explicit PROVENANCE section, the pane-header [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance summary chips, the inline filter bar with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`provenance:`/`machine:` tokens, the provenance cycle key, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transcript preview action.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Open or revive the agent behind a chat[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agentlink[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 7 — Agent link and revival\" section: add the action that jumps [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the selected chat to its agent on the Agents tab, reviving the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent through the existing revive machinery first when it is dismissed, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and degrade clearly when no local agent backs the transcript.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual snapshots and documentation polish[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]after detail, agentlink[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Phase 8 — Visual coverage and docs\" section: add ACE PNG snapshot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage for the populated and empty Chats pane, verify every provenance[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state renders distinctly, and finish the help/onboarding and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CHANGELOG-facing documentation sweep.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-90","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-90.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9aadc0ab2b2e4644fd3f3f93c652e4aa","started_at":"2026-07-24T23:30:51.893696+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1784942320,"sha":"8a0ae2730091422830390c8385b59df993e753e7","subject":"feat(tui): link chats to local agents (sase-90.7)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"b8791208c24a886bf2ed663704826717919bc1a875fa7c97d853bc73e1b5be73","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-90.7/chat.md","size_bytes":7510},"commits":{"digest":"33307fa2d2d234de092142a8ccd5a8199cef26c22171ce440c021ff872aa2369","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-90.7/commits.json","size_bytes":227},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-90.7/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"m